/* Gp057: RECTANGULAR_TRIMMED_SURFACE (u ∈ [0,1], v ∈ [0,1]) on PLANE; pcurve LINE extends from (0,0) to (1.3, 0.8) in UV — u=1.3 exceeds u_max=1.0 trim boundary; FixAddCurve3d generates 3D curve from full pcurve domain without clipping to trim window; 3D curve extends past face boundary; trim-unaware extension IS the defect mechanism */
